Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, bubblewrap, desktop-file-utils,
 ffmpeg, ffmpegthumbnailer, fontconfig, gstreamer1.0-libav,
 gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12),
 libgtksourceview-5-0, gvfs, gvfs-backends, libpoppler-glib8t64 | libpoppler-glib8,
 xdg-utils, shared-mime-info
Provides: strata
Description: Strata file manager (upstream signed release binary)
 Strata (io.github.lgse.Strata) is a GTK4 file manager. This package wraps the
 upstream release binary verified at build time (Ed25519-signed manifest +
 SHA-256), installs it as /usr/bin/strata, registers its desktop entry and the
 org.freedesktop.FileManager1 D-Bus service, and makes it the default handler
 for inode/directory.
